## 4. Deforestation Drivers

The Itombwe rainforest faces multiple threats that the project aims to address:

| **Driver** | **Description** |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Charcoal production** | High demand for charcoal in urban centres |
| **Illegal logging** | Unsustainable timber extraction |
| **Artisanal mining** | Gold and other mineral extraction |
| **Agricultural expansion** | Slash-and-burn agriculture and shifting cultivation |
| **Population pressure** | Increasing population in surrounding areas |
| **Infrastructure development** | Road building and other development |

